# Never commit a key. The .example template is the exception and must ship,
# otherwise nobody knows which variables exist.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Brand kits are client material and this repository is public. Kits live in
# a folder outside the repository; nothing under brand-kits/ is committed but its README.
brand-kits/*
!brand-kits/README.md

